# cold
# The tier's panel in Preferences > Performance (PanelHardwareTier.cpp) at 1440 and 2880 px wide: the tier, what it
# turns on (Focus Detail's lines only where it streams: core/HardwareTier.cpp tierTurnsOn). CMake sets
# SF_HW_PROFILE_IN_TESTS=1, SF_NO_CALIBRATION=1 and SF_HW_SIMULATE=high, as for hardware_tier.sfui.
run new_sphere
wait 0.5
click "Got it"
wait 0.3
click "Performance tier##perf.tier_chip"
wait 0.5
expect_text "What this turns on:"
expect_text Free memory is watched
shot panel
